Z||000000||doughboySE||02-27-2000||09:22 PM||||well guys its done and man what a difference.<BR>i wanted to install it on the floor like i have seen but it had to be put back in a sealed box thus not leaveing me enough room in the floor well. so we made a box for behind the passenger seat. i dont have the measurements right here with me but its aprox 2 feet tall i foot wide and i know its 6 inches deep all sealed with a 12 inch phinoex gold saphire sub in it. its not crossed over yet as i want to buy an electronic cross over on wed we hooked my buddies cross over to it and man it doubled the already wowser boom!<BR>so the way the sterio is hoojked up is the deck runs the rear 4 by 6 speekers, the 80 watt sony amp runs the from (factory soon to go) 4 by 10 speekers and the pioneer mono amp runs the sub.<BR>only thing i may do is sink the box a little into the wall behind the seat as im just not totally comfortable about the seat up as far as it has to be <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> which isnt really that far but i like things perfect. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> i will have pics this week and pics of my fog lights and neon lights <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
