Z||000004||doughboySE||03-01-2000||04:26 PM||||well the pics are taken but noone seemed interested so i have not got them scanned yet. i figured if someone was doing a sterio and needed help they would message me.<BR>as for where the wire went , i put it through the4 hole you are talking about there is some sort or corigated pipe in mine which gave me perfect access to the battery i would suggest going through that.<BR>as for how it sounds <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">))))))))))))<BR>loud and lots of base but not as good as it will with new 4 by 10 in the dash and a electronic crossover.<BR>this weekend im shortening my shifter.sinking that box 2 or 3 inches to give more seat room and pulling the seats out and having the drivers one repaired i cant wait.<BR>if your interested in pics let me know ill post them for you <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
